{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgJVaUhDebHhsVwfB5Fii","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A prudent agent exists at modal depth 2, and no agent of depth 0 or 1 can be prudent. `/work/SUBMIT` is written, but I haven't checked the final `answer.md`. sonnet2 and I both wrote to it at about the same time, and sonnet2 says their version overwrote mine with the same content.\n\n**Q1.** The agent is PrudentBot: `B(a & (B(F) | ~d))`. Run through `check.py`, it defects against CooperateBot and DefectBot. It cooperates with FairBot, FairBot cooperates back, and it cooperates with itself. The checker reports prudent: YES. `B(a) & B(B(F) | ~d)` also works.\n\n**Q2.** A depth-1 agent at world 1 only sees the atoms at world 0.\n- **FairBot forces C at world 1.** FairBot cooperates with X only if X cooperates with FairBot at every world. So X must cooperate with FairBot at world 1.\n- **FairBot and CooperateBot look the same at world 0.** At world 0 every box is vacuously true. So X sees a = c = d = 1 whether it faces FairBot or CooperateBot.\n- **Contradiction.** X therefore acts the same against both at world 1, and against CooperateBot that action is its stable value. X would have to cooperate with CooperateBot, which prudence forbids.\n\nThe argument covers formulas of any size, with or without constants.\n\n**Q3.** I only got a partial answer. The problem's enumeration found no prudent agent up to 7 symbols at depth 2, and PrudentBot has 8, so 8 looks like the minimum size without constants. I took that enumeration as given and didn't re-run it. I didn't try to characterize all minimal-depth prudent agents."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":440,"cache_read_input_tokens":25346,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":440,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":588,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"a3c97900-83d0-4a07-b953-bbca2955c090","uuid":"b8b755e8-e00a-4386-95e0-a739c90d3134","timestamp":"2026-10-23T03:54:49.082Z","request_id":"req_011CgJVaTjS4WeFQ3MH3M675"}
